{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Monkey Mania",
    "steam_appid": 3865360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865360/extras/ae4389879660cb36bc0239b5a8b10d5f.avif?t=1752163311\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey Mania</strong> is a multiplayer online party chatroom game where you can chill, compete in minigames, discover goofy fruits and bugs, and swing around the world with your other monkey friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIGAMES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different minigames for you and your friends to compete in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing</strong> - Race around the different maps to see who is the fastest monkey!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag</strong> - Be the last monkey swinging in this fun timed gamemode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infection</strong> - Run from the infected monkeys and try to survive!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COSMETICS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of fun cosmetics and skins by winning minigames and catching bugs! From civilized top hats and monocles to goofy pirate eye patches and hats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWING AROUND WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey Mania is meant to be a place to chat and chill with fellow monkey friends or strangers! Communicate with a funny proximity chat system and an in game chat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUG CATCHING AND FRUIT GATHERING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare and exotic bugs to sell for cosmetics and other unlocks! Discover goofy magical fruits that you can eat to get weird and bizarre effects, or throw them at your friends and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong> - talk to nearby monkeys naturally!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing, tag, infection</strong> gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy <strong>ragdoll physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep <strong>progression</strong> - Unlock cosmetics unique to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug catching</strong> - Discover rare insects with your monkey crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> - Mess with your friends by throwing goofy fruits with magical effects or pushing them around the map!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865360/extras/ae4389879660cb36bc0239b5a8b10d5f.avif?t=1752163311\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey Mania</strong> is a multiplayer online party chatroom game where you can chill, compete in minigames, discover goofy fruits and bugs, and swing around the world with your other monkey friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIGAMES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different minigames for you and your friends to compete in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing</strong> - Race around the different maps to see who is the fastest monkey!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag</strong> - Be the last monkey swinging in this fun timed gamemode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infection</strong> - Run from the infected monkeys and try to survive!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COSMETICS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of fun cosmetics and skins by winning minigames and catching bugs! From civilized top hats and monocles to goofy pirate eye patches and hats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SWING AROUND WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey Mania is meant to be a place to chat and chill with fellow monkey friends or strangers! Communicate with a funny proximity chat system and an in game chat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUG CATCHING AND FRUIT GATHERING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare and exotic bugs to sell for cosmetics and other unlocks! Discover goofy magical fruits that you can eat to get weird and bizarre effects, or throw them at your friends and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong> - talk to nearby monkeys naturally!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing, tag, infection</strong> gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy <strong>ragdoll physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep <strong>progression</strong> - Unlock cosmetics unique to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug catching</strong> - Discover rare insects with your monkey crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> - Mess with your friends by throwing goofy fruits with magical effects or pushing them around the map!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A multiplayer chatroom party game where you swing through treetops, hang out, play tag, race, and monkey around!",
